  m_text: 'Welcome to Crush!

    Here are some basic controls...


    Jump - Space

    Sprint
    - L. Shift

    Crouch - C

    Grapple - Hold Tab

    Upgrade - U

    Pick
    Up - L. Click

    Throw - R. Click/B

    Equip Weapons after Pick Up- R (with
    nothing already equipped)

    Add/Remove Weapons to Inventory - X

    (Hands
    must be empty to remove weapons from inventory)'
